<title>PORTUGAL: Bank/Portugal injects 7.483 bln esc, 7.15 pct.</title>
<headline>Bank/Portugal injects 7.483 bln esc, 7.15 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Portugal said it injected 7.483 billion escudos of one-day funds into the money market at a fixed rate of 7.15 percent in an extraordinary repo after the close of the latest commercial bank reserve period.</p>
</text>
